        "text": "KHONSERA"
      },
      {
        "top": 94,
        "left": 261,
        "text": "Scoring nudge: a +15% tiebreaker toward this mode when it's a close call. Legacy options ('rail', 'mixed', 'compare') are kept for older accounts and treated as 'no preference' by the scorer."
      },
      {
        "top": 140,
        "left": 261,
        "text": "WALKING THRESHOLD (MIN)"
      },
      {
        "top": 210,
        "left": 261,
        "text": "Above this length, the scorer drops walk from the candidates entirely."
      },
      {
        "top": 240,
        "left": 261,
        "text": "TAXI SPEND (£)"
      },
      {
        "top": 310,
        "left": 261,
        "text": "When would a taxi feel like good value vs. a bit much? We'll suggest taxis under this amount, mention it when they're a bit over, and only push more expensive ones when they save significant time."
      },
      {
        "top": 357,
        "left": 261,
        "text": "DEFAULT LUGGAGE"
      },
      {
        "top": 425,
        "left": 261,
        "text": "Affects how much walk is penalised. Light = -10, heavy = -25."
      },
      {
        "top": 455,
        "left": 261,
        "text": "DEFAULT DRIVING ORIGIN"
      },
      {
        "top": 523,
        "left": 261,
        "text": "Where the planner assumes you'll be driving from."
      },
      {
        "top": 553,
        "left": 261,
        "text": "DEFAULT RAIL ORIGIN"
      },
      {
        "top": 622,
        "left": 261,
        "text": "Your nearest/preferred station."
      },
      {
